        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Replace Jackson 20-330 Concealed Overhead Closer</b>\r\n<p> <b>Build an assembly</b>. Choose your closer spring size, closer  arm and door pivot.  Replaces <b>Jackson 20-330</b> and <b>International 200</b> series Double acting Concealed Overhead Closers.</p>\r\n<p><b>4 different Closer spring sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><a href=\"/products/light-3-spring-double-acting-concealed-overhead-door-closer-global-tc7020\"><b>Light Spring Size #3</b></a> : Maximum Door Size: 30\" Wide, 125 lbs</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/products/medium-4-spring-double-acting-concealed-overhead-door-closer-jackson-20-330-replace\"><b>Medium Spring Size #4</b></a> : Maximum Door Size: 41\" Wide, 175 lbs</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/products/heavy-5-spring-double-acting-concealed-overhead-door-closer-global-tc7040\"><b>Heavy Spring Size #5</b></a> : Maximum Door Size: 48\" Wide, 225 lbs</li> \r\n<li><a href=\"/products/adjustable-spring-ada-compliant-double-acting-concealed-overhead-door-closer-global-tc7010\"><b>ADA Compliant Adjustable Spring #1- #4</b></a>: Maximum Door Size: 48\" Wide, 225 lbs</li>\r\n</ul></p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/INX-345-specifications.gif?v=1704354747\" width=\"581\" height=\"128\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Jackson 20-330  Closer Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>\r\n4 different optional <a href=\"/collections/global-tc7000-series-jackson-20-330\">Closer Arms</a> are available:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>Center Hung Doors - Double or Single Acting</b>\r\n<li><a href=\"/products/tc7000-series-jackson-20-330-side-load-arm\"><b>(SLA) Side Load Arm</b></a> \"S\" Type adjustable Side Load Arm Assembly: 1/2\" deep top rail</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/products/tc7000-series-jackson-20-330-end-load-arm\"><b>(ELA) End Load Arm</b></a> \"A\" Type End Load Arm (ELA) assembly: 1\" deep top rail</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/products/tc7000-series-jackson-20-330-k-type-end-load-arm\"><b>(KRM) End Load Arm</b></a> \"K\" Type End Load Arm (KRM) assembly: 5/8\" deep top rail</li>\r\n\r\n<b>Offset Hung Doors - Single Acting</b>\r\n<li><a href=\"/products/tc7000-series-jackson-20-330-offset-arm-and-track\"><b>(OFFSET) Offset Arm and Track</b></a> JO Mortised Type Offset  Arm and Track assembly: 9/16\" deep top rail - aluminum</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/Omnia-041-deadbolt.gif?v=1704354533\" width=\"580\" height=\"200\" border=\"0\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>4 different optional <a href=\"/collections/global-tc7000-series-jackson-20-330\">Door Pivot Sets</a> are available:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><a href=\"/products/universal-center-hung-bottom-pivot-set\"><b>OHC-Pivot</b></a> - Adjustable Dual Purpose bottom pivot set - Standard application</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/products/jackson-20-728-ae-center-hung-bottom-pivot\"><b>AE-Pivot</b></a> - Adjustable threshold mount bottom pivot set - 1\" deep bottom rail</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/products/jackson-20-944-ge-center-hung-bottom-pivot\"><b>GE-Pivot</b></a> - Adjustable threshold mount bottom pivot set - 1-1/2\" deep bottom rail</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/products/jackson-20-1680-bv-center-hung-bottom-pivot\"><b>BV-Pivot</b></a> - Adjustable floor mount bottom pivot set - 1\" deep bottom rail</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/omnia-1300-series-size.gif?v=1704442278\" width=\"580\" height=\"200\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Pivot Sets\">\r\n</p>",
